+  // Render scale. The guest always renders 1280x720; this multiplies every
+  // render target, opaquely to the game (Xenia's integer resolution scaling).
+  // 2 is exactly the Vision Pro window's pixel count (1280x720 points at 2x),
+  // which is why it is the visionOS default and 1 is the iOS one -- the
+  // defaults live in the cvar definitions (cache.cpp), so whichever value is
+  // NOT the platform default is the one written to ge.toml, and the player's
+  // choice survives relaunch. Restart-required, exactly like the row above:
+  // render targets, the EDRAM bookkeeping and the pipeline cache are all keyed
+  // on the scale.
